  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_343765dc3b7d4551abeb08cc62c5d1c3",
      "statement": "`package.json` defines the canonical Bun workflows: `bun run dev` runs `cargo tauri dev` (whose beforeDevCommand stages sidecars then starts Vite on port 1420), `bun run build` runs `cargo tauri build --bundles app --ci` followed by `scripts/build-dmg.ts`, and `bun run sidecar:stage` runs the staging script alone; `check:all` chains the frontend, Bun-test, Rust, and worker gates.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L16-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9992f9f84ce4e43ccdf07753f63016696a20ed8b1e6a8c75ad0beee90d512878:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3a0ef80d0efd4f4f8a0e47e187dd7946",
      "statement": "`stage-sidecars.ts` downloads the pinned uv 0.12.5 release archive for aarch64-apple-darwin, verifies the archive SHA-256 against a pinned constant (mismatch aborts with SidecarStageError), extracts it into `src-tauri/binaries/uv-aarch64-apple-darwin` with mode 0755, and short-circuits the download when an existing binary already hashes to the pinned binary checksum; this binary is what tauri.conf.json declares as `externalBin: [\"binaries/uv\"]`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/stage-sidecars.ts#L30-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bcf35650b1c610538274f13f6dff8b5ec9ed46843b943e4039e2d1b4b62676e4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/tauri.conf.json#L39-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8364d45b5f84793ea687cf5600fb8fd517946c5e602afd991c7a2479b4dee6b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9c25ef0c7bb144eeaab2bfb96679698d",
      "statement": "`stage-sidecars.ts` deletes and rebuilds `src-tauri/resources/worker/` from `worker/`: the galpi_worker package is copied recursively excluding __pycache__/.pyc, plus the four requirements files (requirements.txt, requirements.lock, requirements-qwen3.txt, requirements-qwen3.lock); both staging destinations are gitignored generated output that must never be edited by hand — worker changes go to worker/ and are re-staged.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.gitignore#L1-L11",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5ec03d5756866f198b7cf20966006b3cf378a186d2ff4b993abb26cca42a40d1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/stage-sidecars.ts#L56-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2530e2afa9abff415ab8d3f04fe3ab934dfcbffef11b9a8cda35676d6b9581e3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3dc5c89519fa48b5a2ac087182a1099e",
      "statement": "The host resolves sidecars by build profile: `uv_binary()` returns `src-tauri/binaries/uv-aarch64-apple-darwin` in debug builds and the `uv` binary beside the current executable in release builds (where Tauri places the externalBin); `worker_root()` returns the repo checkout `../worker` in debug and `<resource_dir>/resources/worker` in release — so debug exercises live worker source and release exercises exactly the staged copy.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/src/adapters/outbound/paths.rs#L73-L95",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a7e25f265aa5dbab405d506d37a7c7b8429b4a16f45c7942a6839456f2881d44:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dfd5cab46a184796ac7afe2300f5fbc6",
      "statement": "tauri.conf.json declares productName Galpi, version 0.1.0, identifier com.m16khb.galpi, a CSP locking default-src to 'self' with ipc: connect-src, macOS minimumSystemVersion 14.0 with Entitlements.plist and ad-hoc signingIdentity '-', bundle targets [\"app\"] only, externalBin binaries/uv, and resources resources/worker; both build before-commands start with `bun run sidecar:stage` and frontendDist points at ../dist.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/tauri.conf.json#L1-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a9de57169dd494c89e9461035bc5bb00f9f306e059d19c554176a4c4f073012e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_55fd8c359dfd4aa48b8dc8adaaa092f1",
      "statement": "Because tauri.conf.json's frontendDist points at ../dist and the Tauri context macro (`generate_context!`) expands against that output, any Rust build or `cargo test` requires `bun run vite:build` to have run first; the CI Rust job encodes this by running vite:build before fmt/clippy/test.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/ci.yml#L33-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d735ad94d9250bcf1dd3ed2707dfa0134862b49c9ee7262389c4932ab4f2ce4:"
