    },
    {
      "id": "claim_27e1a893cf334bbd86bf1aa8da3a313d",
      "statement": "build.rs hashes worker/requirements.txt and worker/requirements-qwen3.txt with FNV-1a, emits the 16-hex-digit digests as compile-time env vars GALPI_WHISPERX_REQUIREMENTS_HASH and GALPI_QWEN3_REQUIREMENTS_HASH, declares cargo::rerun-if-changed for both files, fails the build via cargo::error if either file is missing, and only then runs tauri_build::build().",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/build.rs#L7-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ad3ebbf83a6f7c10831763c597daa2445578ad253222ac75555f2af0fa56a7b3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8f41010620d94003bbc7b202aa20b945",
      "statement": "environment.rs composes readiness markers from the compiled hashes — whisperx_marker() is \"3.8.6\"+whisperx-hash and qwen3_marker() is \"2\"+qwen3-hash — so editing a pinned dependency changes the next build's compiled hash, the marker comparison in status() fails, and the next prepare reinstalls the venv and rewrites the marker without any version bump: the pin edit invalidates installed virtualenvs on its own.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/build.rs#L15-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:de41b8b08f31303c0fcf21044ea6d8611b5af41ae38da4e012823b19116f7647:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/src/adapters/outbound/environment.rs#L14-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d011928ae7a658159dcf97c036953482f1b4a1cf9f529ab45308e51c5909030f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1000a2c5da5f402d8cfe5350390411ef",
      "statement": "setup.rs writes the readiness marker after a successful venv install — whisperx_marker() into engine/ready-3.8.6 (file name hardcoded in paths.rs) and qwen3_marker() into engine/qwen3/ready-qwen3-<QWEN3_ENGINE_VERSION> (\"2\") — so bumping an engine version means changing the version constant, the marker file name (for WhisperX), and the worker's manifest payload in one change set or readiness never turns true again.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/src/adapters/outbound/paths.rs#L37-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d1bea2973f3e43e7c1de003e0c34fd71cb4374c8b7629bf561b95da537836bc7:"
