    {
      "id": "claim_5f0234a69dae454f8f02acdcbcf71d7c",
      "statement": "build-dmg.ts reads the version from src-tauri/tauri.conf.json — the same file the bundler reads — and names the artifact Galpi_<version>_aarch64.dmg; a missing or empty version raises DmgBuildError, so a release can never ship a DMG named after the previous version.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/build-dmg.ts#L15-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:35d03db9d1ad33f0519cd43a3819dc24702b250ee67b622a299481bcef3c085e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e1fa35e4bf81413390c7308f3d968d45",
      "statement": "build-dmg.ts requires Galpi.app (checked via Contents/Info.plist) from the preceding tauri build, cleans stale output (bundle/dmg, bundle/share, and rw.*.dmg droppings in bundle/macos), stages Galpi.app plus an /Applications symlink in a temp directory, runs `hdiutil create -volname Galpi -format ULMO` (LZMA-compressed UDIF), raises DmgBuildError on any non-zero subprocess exit, and removes the staging directory in a finally block.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/build-dmg.ts#L39-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f81e4f7cc17904b8c92ce64f7b96e531500a2eb5d261d9628392955a9524e77a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b5a5ec34fb3d4705b25e8a9d6070d97f",
      "statement": "The Release workflow triggers on pushing v* tags or manual workflow_dispatch; its single dmg job runs on macos-15 (Apple Silicon, the only supported platform) with contents: write permission, and uploads a galpi-dmg artifact from src-tauri/target/release/bundle/dmg/*.dmg with if-no-files-found: error so a build that produced no DMG fails the job.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/release.yml#L1-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:be7565ec2b6946faec6018f63542e052a8368dc8fdf2f31d749d8d6422ddffba:"
