    {
      "id": "claim_60e2d16d4e7d4a10b2473425deee3563",
      "statement": "When APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY is present, the release job verifies the built Galpi.app passes Gatekeeper — `codesign --verify --deep --strict` followed by `spctl --assess --type execute` (the check a recipient's Mac performs on a notarized, stapled build) — and any failure fails the release before artifact upload.",
