      "id": "claim_6b294fa8d23b4988a3ca380741559944",
      "statement": "The release job runs no test gates itself; quality checks live in the CI workflow (frontend check+bun test, Rust fmt/clippy/test, worker ruff+unittest, all on macos-15), so a release tag is expected to point at a commit CI has already verified.",
