    {
      "id": "claim_6a7ffa9802e644c1b6fdbb8b16c2b979",
      "statement": "Everything is ARM64-only: rust-toolchain.toml tracks stable with clippy/rustfmt and the aarch64-apple-darwin target, the enforced MSRV is rust-version 1.88 in Cargo.toml (let-chains), and the release profile uses fat LTO, one codegen unit, opt-level 3, and strip while keeping the default panic unwind so a panic in the audio writer thread fails the recording instead of losing it.",
