    {
      "id": "claim_140181f8e3824e2eba356a09dba3cb3f",
      "statement": "All CI jobs and the release job run on macos-15 because the app only ships for arm64 macOS 14+, so the gates run on the platform they describe; Vite builds with target safari17 because the window ships inside the WKWebView macOS 14+ provides, with no older engine to down-level for.",
